/bin/
coverage.out

# Retained eval runs. A battery that prints the judged table writes its findings
# here when NITPICK_EVAL_DUMP is UNSET; with it set they go to the path it names
# instead and nothing lands here. That default is what lets the columns a
# held-out run could not be read for be re-derived without spending the corpus
# again. They are run artifacts, not collected evidence — the committed evidence
# lives in internal/evals/testdata.
.eval-runs/

# Never commit credentials. This repo is a CI tool that holds model API keys
# and forge tokens; a leaked .env is the whole ballgame.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# make dist output
dist/
resume.md

# Documentation site staging and output (make docs)
.website/
public/

# The contributor corpus is other projects source code, generated by a
# tool that no longer exists here. It must never be committed.
internal/modelid/
